    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Distributed Tracing Architecture & Navigation",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Distributed Tracing & Correlation Workflow (Grafana Tempo + Alloy OTLP + Traefik)\n1. **Architecture:** Traefik Ingress (`traefik-ingress`) generates W3C `traceparent` spans for all incoming HTTP/HTTPS requests and exports OTLP gRPC (`:4317`) to **Grafana Alloy**, which batches and forwards spans to **Grafana Tempo**.\n2. **Trace-to-Logs:** Every Traefik JSON access log and `finance-backend` JSON log records the `trace_id`. Clicking the **Logs for this span** icon in Tempo (or clicking **Inspect Trace in Tempo** on a log entry in Loki) jumps directly between the trace and its logs.\n3. **Deep Dive Search:** For full TraceQL tag builder and span flamegraphs, open [**Grafana Explore -> Tempo**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22Tempo%22%7D)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "OTLP Spans Received (Alloy)",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "VictoriaMetrics"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "VictoriaMetrics"
          },
          "expr": "sum(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans_total{cluster=\"homelabs\"})",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
